      "value": "You're only pushing Q2 to the limits, made things only more worser with more FPS loss. You seems don't understand why some Quest games don't look nice. It's just limits of GPU, it just cannot do much better without fps loss.\nWe can make more better, but that will cause more fps drop, and that is exactly not what we want. Accept it and wait for better future headsets where GPU can do more.",
