  "created": "2022-03-17T00:08:00.027Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently Standard-lite only supports the metallic workflow, which isn't very good for non-metal surfaces and causes an ugly grey-sheen over the whole avatar, A (somewhat) solution would be adding Standard Lite specular so that the specular PBR workflow can be used instead, Toon-shading is not a viable solution for the model in question as I still want specular highlights and realistic shading.",
